data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Reworked the layout in `src/App.jsx` so the Card is centered both vertically and horizontally in the space between the Header and Footer.\\n\\nWhat changed:\\n- Added a direct child of `AppShell` that wraps `Page` and is a flex container with `flex: 1 1 auto`, `display: flex`, `alignItems: center`, and `justifyContent: center`. This wrapper fills the remaining viewport height after the Header and centers the `Page` inside it.\\n- Added `alignItems: center` and `justifyContent: center` to `Page` so the `Card` is centered within the page content area.\\n- Kept all existing behavior: Header title, greeting text, colour tokens from design-system `--color-*` variables, the four labelled buttons, active-button variant logic, Footer text, style imports, server binding, README, and `.gitignore`.\\n\\nVerification:\\n- `npm run build` completed successfully.\\n- `npm run dev` started and bound to `0.0.0.0:5173` (Vite reported `Network: http://10.89.2.201:5173/`).\\n\\nBranch committed to:\\n`cs-sandbox/<DEVELOPER:1>.<GROUP:1>`\\n\\nLatest commits:\\n- `0cf727b Center Card vertically and horizontally between Header and Footer`\\n- `6368d0e Implement React greeting-colour interface per DESIGN.md`\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d003-summary.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_60","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959359,"id":"chatcmpl-d04f2afe8748441181c1053fc8241c11","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

